<p>You can change the orientation of paper placed on the bypass tray.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="define" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Set Paper Position in Bypass Tray</span></p>
<p>To place paper in portrait orientation, select the <span class="Term-Soft">Place 
 as Portrait</span> check box. For landscape orientation, select the <span class="Term-Soft">Place as Landscape</span> check box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Closes the dialog box without saving any changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
